Packaging scope
---------------

This repository contains ONLY the Home Assistant OS packaging layer:

  grok2api/config.yaml      Home Assistant add-on manifest
  grok2api/build.yaml       base image pinning (upstream image tag)
  grok2api/Dockerfile       thin layer on top of the upstream image
  grok2api/rootfs/...       entrypoint, bootstrap and healthcheck scripts
  grok2api/translations/    option translations
  grok2api/icon.png         generated add-on icon (this repository)
  grok2api/logo.png         generated add-on logo (this repository)

The server binary, the Web UI bundle and the provider integration code are
taken unmodified from the upstream project `chenyme/grok2api` v3.1.8 and stay
under the upstream MIT license and copyright (Chenyme). The add-on does not
patch, rebuild or redistribute modified upstream code: the Dockerfile only
installs four Alpine packages and copies the scripts in `rootfs/`.

The icon and logo in this repository are original artwork generated by
`tools/make_branding.py`; they are not upstream trademarks.
